BACKUP/RESTORE SEMANTICS
------------------------
- Export: reads live stores, writes JSON to path
- Backup: creates point-in-time copy of entire store
- Import: validates, refuses conflicts, imports derived data
- Dry-run: shows what would happen without modifying target
- Tamper detection: checksum/integrity check on backup file
- Conservative: never silently overwrite divergent live stores

